  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v0.3.1 — CI/CD publish trigger moved from `main` to `product` to match the TechTeaStudio release-branch convention.\n\nv0.3.0 — Documentation, CI/CD pipeline, and the Hyperion-legacy nameid claim adapter.\n\nAdded:\n  * GitHub Actions CI/publish workflow (.github/workflows/dotnet.yml) targeting the shared TechTeaStudio reusable workflow.\n  * Hyperion-legacy fallback in JwtTokenReader: when the token has no sub claim, UserId is read from the legacy nameid claim.\n  * docs/RECIPES.md — 10 ready-to-paste patterns: login, refresh, revoke, reset, email confirmation, 2FA enrollment, API keys, audit, metrics, multi-app claim profiles.\n  * docs/MIGRATION-Hyperion.md and docs/MIGRATION-Pello.md — step-by-step migration guides.\n  * SECURITY.md — threat model + reporting policy.\n  * Re-aligned README with the actually shipped public API.\n\nFull changelog: https://github.com/TechTeaStudio/Auth/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md",
